-# A person already in the pool, or a share that is not more than 0.00 and at most 100.00 with at most two decimals, is
-# refused with 422 and nothing is stored or recorded.
+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/pool-members — adds a person, or another pool, to a pool. Body
+# {"pool":"...","personId":1,"share":"50.00"} or {"pool":"...","memberPool":"...","share":"50.00"}. A person already in
+# the pool, a pool already a member of a pool, a pool containing itself through any chain, a chain more than three deep,
